Taken from commit e8d7d9705a7a2c89cef4dd42079379f05685af87, and modified
by Den (issue 770: agent state from screen rules):

  src/detect/manifests/claude.toml -> src/shared/agents/detect/rules/claude.ts
  src/detect/manifests/codex.toml  -> src/shared/agents/detect/rules/codex.ts
  src/detect/manifests/gemini.toml -> src/shared/agents/detect/rules/gemini.ts
  src/detect/manifests/grok.toml   -> src/shared/agents/detect/rules/grok.ts
      The rules, rewritten from TOML as TypeScript modules. The rules
      themselves are unchanged.
